Error [E0068]: this callable uses the retired result-arrow shape.
  --> tests/ui/dispatch_missing_eq.jet:5:24
    |
  5 | fn classify(code: Int) => String {
    |                        ^^
 Why: a return type sits after the parameter list, and `->` introduces the body; an effect ceiling follows the return type
 Fix: write `fn name(...) Type -> body`, or `fn name(...) Type -[Effects]> { … }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0068

Error [E0992]: a multi-arm `if` needs a comparison between the subject and `{`
  --> tests/ui/dispatch_missing_eq.jet:6:5
    |
  6 |     if code {
    |     ^^
 Why: `if subject == { … }` (or `<`, `>`, `!=`, `<=`, `>=`) marks value dispatch explicitly, so a plain `if cond { … }` body is always statements
 Fix: write `if subject == { value -> body }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0992
